th_id":"1~33","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":36,"section_id":"sec-1~33"},{"title":"Table 11 :","text":"11Number of trainable parameters in uncorrelated k-out-of-n systems.MethodNetwork n = 3n = 5n = 10n = 50n = 100QMIXAgent Mixer27,587 18,65727,715 41,24928,035 133,569 5,430,657 30,59533,795 42,202,113QVMixAgent Mixer27,587 64,77127,715 110,083 295,043 10,891,779 84,437,891 28,035 30,595 33,795QPLEXAgent Mixer27,587 58,24927,715 83,28928,035 155,269 1,830,933 30,59533,795 4,901,797COMAAgent Critic27,587 35,97127,715 45,95528,035 70,91530,595 1,195,90733,795 10,840,323FACMACAgent Critic27,587 48,00227,715 72,70628,035 134,466 1,042,370 30,59533,795 3,313,218IQLAgent /27,587 027,715 028,035 030,595 033,795 0DQNAgent /157,979 758,003 / 0 0 // // /","level":1,"path_id":"1~34","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":37,"section_id":"sec-1~34"},{"title":"Table 12 :","text":"12Hardware configurations for training and testing experiments.Parameters Train only on CPUs Train on GPUs Test only on CPUs Test on GPUsNumber of CPU 4285RAM5 Gb6 Gb5Gb10 GbExperiments executed on CPUs only2 or 3 agents4 or 5 agents10 agents1430301225252 4 6 8 10 Time (in hours)0.02.55.07.510.012.515.017.520.05 10 15 20 Time (in hours)0.02.55.07.510.012.515.017.520.00 5 10 15 20 Time (in hours)0.02.55.07.510.012.515.017.5Intel(R) Xeon(R) Gold 6248 CPU @ 2.50GHz Intel(R) Xeon(R) Silver 4116 CPU @ 2.10GHz Intel(R) Xeon(R) Gold 5218 CPU @ 2.30GHzIntel(R) Xeon(R) CPU E5-2620 v4 @ 2.10GHz Intel(R) Xeon(R) Silver 4216 CPU @ 2.10GHz AMD EPYC 7763 64-Core Processor","level":1,"path_id":"1~35","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":38,"section_id":"sec-1~35"},{"title":"Table 13 :","text":"13k-out-of-n system best policies (* = campaign cost).nQMIX QVMix QPLEX COMA FACMACIQLDQN Heuristics\n\t\t\t37th Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS 2023) Track on Datasets and Benchmarks.","level":1,"path_id":"1~36","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":39,"section_id":"sec-1~